   "definition": "Prescription check: ok · watch (missed once) · stale (asked 2+ sessions, never met) · impossible (implies an e1RM more than 8 kg above your best) · abandoned (no session in 21+ days)."
  },
  "progression": {
   "source": "computed",
   "definition": "Each lift judged over its sessions since mid-June: progressing = latest session's best beats the previous best by more than 2%; flat = within 2% of the previous best; stalled = no new best in 3+ sessions; regressed = latest below 95% of the best; 1 point = only one session so far."
  }
 }
}
